# Bank 14. Directives: L label, C line comment, B block header, D data
# range, F row width.
#
# The 8192 bytes are 0xFF and NO mapper register ever selects it
# (tools/recon.py checks this). It is filler up to the 128 KB of the
# cartridge. The org 0x8000 it is listed at is our own convention: since it is
# never mapped, it has no address of its own.

B 0x8000 UNUSED BANK
B 0x8000 8192 bytes of 0xFF. No write to the mapper selects it.

D 0x8000 0xA000 filler  0xFF filler up to the full 128 KB of the cartridge.
F 0x8000 16
